{"_comment":"Example config.json (NapCatAPI client + napcat-cli). Copy to ~/.napcat-data/config.json (gitignored) and fill real values. Easier: run 'napcat setup' (interactive) or 'napcat config set <key> <value>'.","_docker_crossmapping_note":"Docker may cross-map host<->container ports (host 18800 -> container 3000 HTTP, host 18801 -> container 3001 WS). So set api_url=http://127.0.0.1:18800, ws_port=18801 (or ws_url=ws://127.0.0.1:18801).","alert_dir":"alerts","api_url":"http://127.0.0.1:18800","event_dir":"events","group_trigger_word":"","http_port":18821,"log_file":"daemon.log","private_trigger":"*","self_id":"","skills_fs_binary":"$HOME/.local/bin/skills-fs","skills_fs_config":"$HOME/.napcat-data/skills-fs.json","skills_fs_enabled":true,"skills_fs_mountpoint":"$HOME/.hermes/skills/napcat-cli","token":"","tui_show_images":true,"wake_cli_command":"","wake_command":"","wake_cooldown_seconds":30,"wake_debounce_seconds":3,"wake_enabled":true,"wake_http_key":"","wake_http_session_id":"","wake_http_url":"","wake_new_message_idle_seconds":600,"wake_on_event":true,"wake_preset":"hermes","wake_primary":"auto","wake_session":"napcat-qq","wake_timeout":300,"webhook_port":18820,"ws_port":18800,"ws_url":""}